# TypeScript and React Native

- Functional components. Export props as a named type when the component is public.
- Strict TypeScript. Do not use `any`.
- Expo SDK 55 and React 19. Do not enable Hermes v1 or the removed legacy architecture flag.
- Prefer theme tokens and NativeWind `className` over inline layout numbers.
- Accessibility role and label are required on pressable controls.
- Keep files focused. Re-export public API from the package `index.ts` only.
